    {
      "id": "6dfb78a2-65bb-476f-84e7-7951ded1efa7",
      "name": "Analyze Anomaly with Gemini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        -432,
        -1088
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Perform a deterministic B2B churn assessment for this enterprise account.\n\nAccount:\n{{ $json.account_name }}\nAccount ID:\n{{$json.account_id }}\nTier:\n{{ $json.account_tier }}\nARR:\n${{ $json.arr_usd }}\n\nCurrent Order:\nOrder ID: {{$json.order_id }}\nOrder Date: {{ $json.order_date }}\nPlaced Volume: {{$json.stats.actual_units }} units\nHistorical Average: {{ $json.stats.baseline_mean_units }} units\nVolume Ratio: {{$json.stats.volume_ratio }}\nVolume Z-Score: {{ $json.stats.volume_z_score }}\n\nOrdering Cadence:\nDays Since Prior Order: {{$json.stats.days_since_last_order }}\nBaseline Cadence: {{ $json.stats.baseline_cadence_days }} days\nCadence Z-Score: {{$json.stats.cadence_z_score }}\n\nProduct Mix:\nPurchased SKUs: {{ $json.sku_list }}\nCore SKUs: {{$json.core_skus }}\nMissing Core SKUs: {{ $json.stats.missing_core_skus.length > 0 ?$json.stats.missing_core_skus.join(', ') : 'None' }}\n\nDetermine the most likely commercial explanation.\n\nDistinguish between:\n1. Dual-sourcing / competitor deflection. A core SKU disappeared while other products were still purchased.\n2. Inventory overhang / burn-off. Order volume compressed but ordering cadence remains broadly normal.\n3. Operational curtailment / downsizing. Purchasing appears broadly reduced across the account.\n4. Mixed or unclear signal when the available evidence does not support one explanation strongly.\n\nDo not invent information that is not present in the input.\nDo not claim that a competitor is definitely involved. Treat competitor deflection as a hypothesis unless directly supported by the data.\n\nProvide exactly two practical, non-defensive procurement talking points for the assigned sales representative.\n\nReturn only the requested structured fields.",
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.4
    },
